name: External observations retain partial authority, explicit consent and process deadlines
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/external_recon.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
paste-file: @ART/nmap.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | host-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 External observations | host-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/external_recon.py nmap @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/nmap-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | host-receipt
ask: Does the receipt make source accuracy and repository coverage limits clear without claiming Map completion or a vulnerability verdict?
paste-file: @ART/passive.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | passive-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 External observations | passive-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/external_recon.py passive @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/passive-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | passive-receipt
expect: liveness was not tested
ask: Is it clear that historical names are context observations and establish no host liveness?
paste-file: @ART/http.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | http-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 External observations | http-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/external_recon.py http @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/http-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | http-receipt
resize: 160x48
live-snap: observations-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: observations-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: observations-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: observations-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | observations-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: observations-paged-40x12
ask: Can an operator read the partial observation result, its limits and return controls across all six terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/missing.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 absent-program | missing-dependency
paste-file: @ART/deadline.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | deadline-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 process deadline reached | deadline-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/external_recon.py failure @TMP_TARGET @ART
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | existing-review
expect: Labeled greeting observation
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | resumed
paste-file: @ART/passive-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered-observation
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/external_recon.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does restart preserve the exact human decision and all receipts, including failed work, without starting probes, accepting context or advancing the phase?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
